# Do not index output artifacts

Generated files are not source. Do not read them to learn the project, do not edit them, and do not commit them.

They stay out of the Cursor index via `.cursorindexingignore` and out of git via `.gitignore`:

- `dev/output/` — check screenshots and logs
- `dist/`, `build/`, `out/`, `.output/`, `coverage/`, `test-results/`
- `*.log`, `.DS_Store`

Commands that write reports or screenshots must write under `dev/output/`. If a new output kind appears, add it to both ignore files in the same change.

```
# ❌ commit or patch a generated file
git add dev/output/profile.png

# ✅ regenerate ignored output, then edit source
node dev/check.mjs
```
